{"parse": {"title": "共鸣回波", "pageid": 144565, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Item-490002.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Item-490002.png\">共鸣回波</a></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>共鸣回波</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>490002</div></div><hr /><div>动摇思绪的万千浪潮，足以锤炼观念，颠覆视角。可以将任意一名共鸣/觉察等级小于15的六星角色的共鸣/觉察等级提升至15级。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">潮涌无形，却可冲溃障壁。灵思再无边界，头脑于其中遨游。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1#15#5#15\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%82%E6%9C%AA%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81\" title=\"暂未支持\"><img alt=\"Bgequip2.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/100px-Bgequip2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/150px-Bgequip2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Bgequip2.png/200px-Bgequip2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Item-1\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Item-1\">暂未支持</a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"